Those artifacts are neutral, lawful and chaotic.  Sacraficing can
give you artifacts in your own alignment or unaligned ones with
none of the 3 you mention unaligned.  It doesn't matter in the
least how long you keep trying you'll never get all 3 by altar
dancing.  Even if you complete the Quest then convert you'll
still only be able to get up to 2 of them that way.

> Since I don't have hungerless casting, each create monster gives me
