How long to keep altar dancing is a matter of judgement.  Once
you have a good artifact there'slittle benefit to continuing for a
second good artifact so it won't be about ascension just about
score.  One interesing thing about score - Higher score among
non-ascenders is a sign of getting close to ascension.  Lower
score among regular ascenders is a sign of increased skill.
Collect artifacts for fun or to use them with little regard to score.

My preference - If I have about 3 artifacts I no longer altar dance
for artifacts.  I do sometimes altar dance for the other benefits
but only if I have plentiful food available or hungerless casting.


